# episode9\update9.rpy:602
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_21759479:

    # tm "Don't ruin it."
    tm "别搞砸了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:603
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_0c294212:

    # tm "I'm gonna teach you how it's done."
    tm "我要教你怎么做。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:604
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_da7bb980:

    # tm "So, you've made the big decisions already and now it's time for the details."
    tm "所以，你已经做完了那些大决定，现在该处理细节了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:606
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_5f587109:

    # tm "Ask yourself, what's most important when you're planning a party?"
    tm "问自己，办派对时最重要的是什么？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:610
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_1b29a65b:

    # mc "That there's enough alcohol to go around?"
    mc "酒得够所有人喝？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:612
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_0d8bd480:

    # tm "Wrong!"
    tm "错！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:614
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_e3399b86:

    # mc "That there are plenty of girls there?"
    mc "得有足够多的女生？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:616
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_0de3e919:

    # tm "Good thinking, but wrong!"
    tm "想得不错，但还是错！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:618
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_2f99b2b6:

    # mc "That the decorations are spot on?"
    mc "装饰得布置到位？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:620
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_ad315e3d:

    # tm "Pff! Both gay and wrong!"
    tm "噗！又娘炮，又答错了！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:622
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_fd03effd:

    # mc "That there's food for everyone?"
    mc "得让所有人都有东西吃？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:624
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_d3c077cb:

    # tm "Food? We're not looking to attract fatties with our parties. Wrong!"
    tm "食物？我们办派对不是为了吸引那些肥婆。错！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:625
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_282e0f23:

    # tm "The most important thing about planning a party is realizing that even a perfect plan will fail, no matter what you do."
    tm "计划派对最重要的是明白，就算计划再完美，也总会失败，不管你做什么。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:626
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_98b3f147:

    # tm "It doesn't matter if the food sucks, if we run out of some liquor, or if the place looks like shit."
    tm "不管食物有多难吃，哪怕酒喝完了，或者场地看起来像他妈的垃圾场，都没关系。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:628
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_b92f32ba:

    # tm "The moment the party starts, everyone's gonna have a good time anyway because we're the fucking DIKs."
    tm "聚会一开始，大家反正都会玩得开心，因为我们就是他妈的DIKs。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:629
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_588d75cf:

    # tm "Students love our parties! They get to drink at them! They think we're cool no matter what we do."
    tm "学生们都爱我们的派对！来了就有酒喝！不管我们干什么，他们都觉得我们很酷。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:630
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_986cfe56:

    # tm "If the decor is shit, they think we're being ironic. If we only serve vodka, they think it's a theme."
    tm "装饰烂得像屎，他们会以为我们在玩反讽；要是只供应伏特加，他们会以为这是派对主题。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:632
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_571f4a0a:

    # tm "If we order pizza last minute, they think we're awesome for \"caring about them being hungry\"."
    tm "就算最后一刻才点披萨，他们也会觉得我们很贴心，‘还知道怕他们饿着’。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:634
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_5858d835:

    # mc "So, we shouldn't even plan the party?"
    mc "所以，我们根本不用策划派对？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:636
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_7aabe4bc:

    # tm "I didn't say that. We're gonna plan, but if things don't work out, it's not a big deal."
    tm "我没说不用计划。我们还是会计划，但如果搞砸了，也不是什么大不了的事。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:638
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_f0795b39:

    # mc "Ok, so you want me to be more relaxed about it?"
    mc "那你想让我对这事更放松一点？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:640
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_709c19ad:

    # tm "Now you're getting it. You're always so fucking serious about shit, you need to dial it back."
    tm "现在你终于明白了。你总是对事情他妈的太认真，得放松点。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:641
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_c9729787:

    # tm "Planning a party, it's a form of art. Yin and yang! You need to strive for balance."
    tm "筹划派对，这本身就是一种艺术。阴阳调和！你得追求平衡。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:642
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_770065ea:

    # tm "A little bit of beauty inside of the shit, and a little bit of shit inside of the beauty."
    tm "一点美藏在屎里，一点屎藏在美里。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:644
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_1f01cb1e:

    # mc "I've never heard you talk like this before."
    mc "我从来没听过你这么说。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:646
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_ab3f12d3:

    # tm "Do you even know what makes a great party?"
    tm "你知道什么样的派对才算好派对吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:648
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_f9ffc14c:

    # mc "That everyone's having fun?"
    mc "所有人都玩得开心吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:650
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_81416a84:

    # tm "Yeah, you're not far off. Everyone should have fun."
    tm "嗯，你差不多是这个意思。每个人都该玩得开心。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:651
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_544ad2ff:

    # tm "It's not gonna happen because alcohol always finds a way to ruin it for some, but it's what we should aim for."
    tm "这事儿不会成，因为酒精总会让一些人搞砸，但这是我们该追求的目标。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:652
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_790b60fd:

    # tm "And when I say that everyone should have fun, I mean, the DIKs should have fun. A happy host means a great party, and seriously, fuck what the guests want."
    tm "而且我说每个人都要玩得开心，我是说，DIKs应该玩得开心。一个开心的主人意味着一场好派对，说实话，管他那些客人想要什么。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:654
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_f938d3dd:

    # tm "But you've gotta pick your battles. Someone might get disappointed by your choices, but there are other parties, and maybe you take care of them a bit extra next time."
    tm "但你得懂得取舍。你的选择可能会让某些人失望，不过以后还有别的派对，下次再多照顾他们一点就是了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:656
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_e87a3e5c:

    # mc "I see... I can't make everyone happy."
    mc "我明白……我没法让每个人都开心。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:658
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_a7f0a988:

    # tm "You can try, but it might cost a lot more than we have a budget for, or there might not be room for it."
    tm "你可以试试，但可能会花掉比预算多很多的钱，或者根本没有地方安排。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:659
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_63eb6293:

    # tm "Don't go blowing the budget early, though. The more money you save, the better the party activities will be."
    tm "别太早花光预算，钱省下来活动才能办得更好。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:662
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_21d2ea02:

    # mc "Right... The activities."
    mc "对了……活动的事。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:664
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_2953d4ae:

    # tm "The problem is that while the party might last all night, at some point people will get too drunk to wanna do the shit you've planned."
    tm "问题是，虽然派对可能会持续一整晚，但到了某个时候，大家喝得太多，就不想做你计划的那些事情了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:665
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_6c7a576b:

    # tm "Again, we need a balance!"
    tm "再说了，我们还得讲究个平衡！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:666
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_2b16e74e:

    # tm "And since I'm your mentor, I'll help you choose what we'll do for Halloween."
    tm "既然我是你的导师，我会帮你决定万圣节要做什么。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:668
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_fd86cc6e:

    # mc "Actually, I already talked to Sage and Quinn about this."
    mc "其实我之前已经跟Sage和Quinn聊过这事了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:669
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_0657363e:

    # mc "We talked about having a best costume competition and maybe some blindfold games."
    mc "我们聊过办个最佳装扮比赛，可能再搞点蒙眼游戏。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:671
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_96f7d65f:

    # tm "Boring!"
    tm "无聊！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:673
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_3ceab3c0:

    # mc "That's not boring."
    mc "那不算无聊。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:675
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_3116b627:

    # tm "You need to learn, bro. So, I'm not gonna be a dick about this. I'll give you some options and you'll pick."
    tm "你需要明白，伙计。所以我不会故意针对你。我会给你几个选择，你自己挑。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:677
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_ecb9fcad:

    # tm "Picture this! It's early on in the party. People are arriving and have started drinking. No one's dancing yet because they're not drunk."
    tm "想象一下！派对刚开始，大家陆续到场，也已经喝上了。因为还没喝醉，所以暂时没人跳舞。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:678
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_4157111f:

    # tm "Everyone is walking around talking, checking each other out being like, \"What are you supposed to be tonight?\" and \"Damn, that's a nice costume\"."
    tm "大家四处走动、聊天、互相打量，嘴里问着‘你今晚扮的是什么？’‘靠，这身装扮真不错。’"

# episode9\update9.rpy:679
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_62e4bd99:

    # tm "And now's the time for the first activity of the night. What should it be?"
    tm "现在是今晚第一个活动的时间了。该选什么？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:681
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_59eec4fc:

    # mc "What are my options?"
    mc "我有什么选择？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:683
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_64494343:

    # tm "People are still sober, and they want to get drunk. A drinking competition would work."
    tm "人们现在还清醒，都想要喝醉。来个喝酒比赛挺合适。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:684
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_b1240f95:

    # tm "It will cost money since we're encouraging people to drink more. And it can backfire if someone gets too drunk and has to end the night early."
    tm "这样做会花不少钱，因为我们鼓励大家多喝。而且如果有人喝得太猛，提前结束夜晚的话，事情可能会搞砸。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:685
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_0a25ec46:

    # tm "If we wanna spend more money, we could have a body shot battle. That will surely get girls drunk, and it's pretty damn hot."
    tm "要是肯多花点钱，还可以来场人体酒大战。肯定能把女生们灌醉，而且看着他妈特别火辣。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:709
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_c9244b8b:

    # mc "Body shots sound fun. Let's do that one."
    mc "人体酒听起来挺好玩，就选这个吧。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:711
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_00d183cd:

    # tm "All right. Lower your expectations for it, though. Think of it as a warm-up. Girls will still be sober and odds are they won't go too crazy."
    tm "行吧，不过你得降低点预期。把它当个热身活动。女生们还是清醒的，她们大概率不会玩得太疯。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:720
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_bf8eafe6:

    # mc "I like that drinking competition idea. Let's do that one."
    mc "我喜欢这个喝酒比赛的主意。就干这个吧。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:722
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_1299c6af:

    # tm "Awesome. We'll adjust the budget for it."
    tm "好，我们调整一下预算。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:723
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_211a2ab7:

    # tm "People are gonna get wasted, for sure."
    tm "人们肯定会喝到烂醉。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:728
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_fa6b4a4d:

    # mc "Let's save some money instead. Let people talk and have fun on their own for the first part of the night."
    mc "让我们先省点钱。前半段晚上就让大家都自己聊聊天、玩得开心点。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:730
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_ecaf1970:

    # tm "Our parties aren't remembered for being boring. Things need to happen to make them fun."
    tm "我们的派对从来不会因为无聊而被人记住。得有点事情发生，大家才会觉得有趣。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:731
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_0b0b7402:

    # tm "We can save some money here as long as we do something fun later on."
    tm "我们这里可以省点钱，只要后面安排点好玩的事就行了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:734
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_0712d1f3:

    # tm "Now, it's the middle of the party and most people have shown up. Many are drunk and the others are working on it."
    tm "现在派对进行到一半，大多数人已经到场了。很多人已经喝醉了，剩下的也在慢慢喝起来。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:735
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_8b0e7f4a:

    # tm "People are in the mood to dance and have fun, and their inhibitions are lowered. What do we do?"
    tm "大家现在都想跳舞找乐子，也没那么多顾忌了。我们该安排什么？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:737
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_8e76f5a8:

    # tm "And before you go asking me for advice again, let me say what I think."
    tm "别急着问我建议，我有我的看法。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:738
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_0eea8410:

    # tm "We should get dirty and naughty."
    tm "我们该来点刺激的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:740
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_56d6502d:

    # mc "Sure. So, what about that blindfold game I mentioned?"
    mc "行。那我刚才提到的蒙眼游戏怎么样？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:742
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_6eef458c:

    # tm "It's decent, but it's not for Halloween. Why would we? It's much better suited for a panty party or something."
    tm "这倒还行，但不是万圣节搞的。我们干嘛要搞这个？搞个内衣派对或者什么的才更合适。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:744
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_f89f3a5c:

    # mc "Panty parties? We have those?"
    mc "内衣派对？我们有那种吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:746
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_3ad9e2d2:

    # tm "You've got a lot to learn."
    tm "你还有很多要学的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:747
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_634638e8:

    # tm "Many will be dancing, but for the ones who aren't, I say, huddling up and telling scary stories or having some haunted mansion tour where you have to work close to each other."
    tm "不少人会去跳舞，至于不跳的，我看可以围坐着讲恐怖故事，或者来场需要彼此贴近配合的鬼宅探险。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:749
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_c803089a:

    # mc "Let's do that, then. All of it is free, no?"
    mc "那我们就这么做吧。全部都是免费的，对吧？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:751
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_49d2d550:

    # tm "That's naive; it's not free. And the real issue is that we won't have time or space to do all of it."
    tm "这可天真了；这不是免费的。真正的问题是我们没时间和空间做所有这些事。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:763
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_de6df26c:

    # mc "Let's do the storytelling, then."
    mc "那就安排讲恐怖故事吧。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:765
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_7dffe7b4:

    # tm "That will work. While active people wanna dance, lazy asses can sit and tell stories."
    tm "这样安排就行。爱跳舞的就去跳舞，懒得动的就坐下来讲故事。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:771
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_b4a1a588:

    # mc "Let's do dancing and the haunted mansion thingy."
    mc "那我们跳舞加上那个鬼屋巡游吧。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:773
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_9fbf0b45:

    # tm "Yeah, whatever. Make sure you put someone in charge of that haunted mansion tour. It will cost some money."
    tm "随便你吧。记得安排个人负责那个鬼屋巡游，那玩意儿得花点钱。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:778
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_7a48af2f:

    # mc "Let's stick to dancing only. It's hot enough."
    mc "那就只安排跳舞吧，已经够火辣了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:781
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_96ea286e:

    # tm "Ok, we're almost done."
    tm "好，我们快结束了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:782
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_6d762594:

    # tm "It's late in the party. Some people will start dropping off soon, while others might stay until morning."
    tm "现在派对已经到后半段了，有些人已经开始撑不住了，还有人可能会一直待到天亮。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:783
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_533cfed9:

    # tm "Most people are wasted by now. It's the last chance to do something before people don't care about activities."
    tm "现在大多数人已经喝醉了。这是在大家彻底失去兴趣之前最后的机会了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:784
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_acd603db:

    # tm "Hell, some might be off fucking or puking."
    tm "靠，有些人可能已经跑去做爱或者吐了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:786
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_1914725b:

    # tm "Strippers are gonna be here, and while you might think it's enough that they came to party, I wanna get my dick some action."
    tm "脱衣舞女要来了，你以为她们来参加派对就满足了？我可不想让我的家伙闲着。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:787
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_c252c84e:

    # tm "I wanna have a private CUM-petition, so make a budget for it."
    tm "我想私下办场射精大赛，你给它留点预算。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:789
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_69325188:

    # mc "What about the best costume competition?"
    mc "那还有最佳装扮比赛呢？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:791
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_41567de2:

    # tm "Ok, do that one, but don't involve me in it."
    tm "好，那就这么办，但别牵扯到我。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:804
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_87b836bd:

    # mc "Ok, I think we have money to spare for the CUM-petition."
    mc "好，我觉得预算还够办射精大赛。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:806
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_f7f413a0:

    # tm "See, that's how you do it!"
    tm "看吧，这才叫会办事！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:811
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_88870b2e:

    # mc "Sorry, but the budget doesn't cover the CUM-petition."
    mc "抱歉，预算根本不够办这个比赛。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:813
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_76dd0ca6:

    # tm "Are you fucking kidding me!?"
    tm "你他妈在开什么玩笑？！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:814
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_2b35e024:

    # tm "Fuck it. I'm still gonna have it. Guess I won't invite any of you to it."
    tm "算了，我还是要办。反正你们也别想来了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:817
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_94629c16:

    # tm "Ok. Let's start with that, but change your mind if you need to."
    tm "好，我们先从这个开始，不过如果你改主意了也行。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:819
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_afb12522:

    # tm "Go ahead. Let me see you do it for the Halloween party."
    tm "继续吧。让我看看你怎么在万圣节派对上搞这事。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:820
translate schinese ep9_party_planning_label_38d8c713:

    # tm "How would you make the DIKs happy?"
    tm "你怎么让DIKs开心？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:877
translate schinese ep9_pp_cont_label_9d1f9882:

    # mc "Maybe like that?"
    mc "也许就这样？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:884
translate schinese ep9_pp_cont_label_c9b4fb58:

    # tm "I don't know how well you'd have done without my help, but definitely not this good. Let's give it a go, but I expect the plan to fail anyway."
    tm "我不知道你没我帮忙会做得怎么样，但肯定没这么好。我们试试看吧，不过我猜计划还是会失败。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:886
translate schinese ep9_pp_cont_label_7cd6653a:

    # tm "Ok. It's decent. Not the best, but let's give it a go because the plan will fail anyway."
    tm "好。还行吧。不算最好，不过反正计划迟早要失败，咱就试试看。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:888
translate schinese ep9_pp_cont_label_7b63e775:

    # tm "Meh. Kind of shitty, to be honest, but it doesn't matter because the plan will fail anyway."
    tm "嗯，说白了就是挺烂的，但反正计划本来就要失败，所以也就算了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:939
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_d4f4ce5a:

    # mc "That's it, then."
    mc "那就这样吧。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:994
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_84a53c9c:

    # mc "I'll talk to Sage again about the costume competition."
    mc "我再去跟Sage谈谈最佳装扮比赛。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:996
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_60c85f03:

    # tm "Yeah, whatever."
    tm "嗯，随便啦。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:997
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_eb3d2b11:

    # tm "That's it for planning. Any thoughts?"
    tm "那就这样了，有什么想法吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:999
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_d7863867:

    # mc "It's gonna be a fun party."
    mc "这场派对肯定会很有意思。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1001
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_c40a02c8:

    # tm "It better be, or it will be the last one you'll plan."
    tm "不然下次你就别想再计划了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1002
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_5ec4e142:

    # mc "So, can you be responsible for some of these?"
    mc "那你能负责其中一些部分吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1003
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_f5bd9042:

    # tm "Yeah, I'll do some of it."
    tm "嗯，我来负责一部分。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1008
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_ddbcaf26:

    # mc "Great. I'll take food, music and check with the guys about helping out, and you can take care of beer and help with the guest list, maybe?"
    mc "好，我负责食物和音乐，再问问兄弟们谁能帮忙。你负责啤酒，顺便帮忙处理宾客名单，怎么样？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1010
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_e81d373f:

    # mc "Tommy?"
    mc "Tommy？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1016
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_3fdbd37d:

    # mc "I told you to take care of it."
    mc "我让你负责的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1018
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_8738638d:

    # tm "Look. Do you need me to take care of it or not?"
    tm "你到底需要我管不管？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1020
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_f800bed0:

    # mc "Yes."
    mc "嗯。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1022
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_d8b7d623:

    # tm "Say the magic words."
    tm "说点好听的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1025
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_0df40aaf:

    # mc "Fuck. You."
    mc "去。你。妈。的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1028
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_33590b52:

    # mc "Please, Tommy. Help me find the kegs."
    mc "求你了，Tommy。帮我找到那些啤酒桶。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1032
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_f1543d75:

    # tm "Found them. Now you can stop being a baby."
    tm "找到了。现在别再像个小孩一样闹了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1034
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_c83d796e:

    # tm "Found them."
    tm "找到了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1036
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_b0e609e2:

    # tm "The guest list doesn't matter, either. Uninvited guests always show up."
    tm "宾客名单也没那么重要，总会有没受邀请的人跑来。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1037
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_623caa6c:

    # tm "It's cool if they do. The only exceptions are jocks, preps and nerds; kick them out if they show up."
    tm "没关系，只要他们不捣乱就行。唯一不能留的是橄榄球队的、富家子弟和书呆子，要是他们来了就赶出去。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1039
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_04fc99b6:

    # mc "You had the beer all this time?"
    mc "啤酒桶一直都在你手里？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1041
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_667ec55c:

    # tm "I'm trying to teach you a lesson."
    tm "我在试着给你上一课。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1043
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_a6e04c0c:

    # mc "Is the lesson that I can't trust you?"
    mc "这课的意思是我不该相信你？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1045
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_72b5e7a3:

    # tm "Eh, shut up. Go put on the matching bra to your outfit."
    tm "行了，闭嘴。去把跟你这身配套的胸罩穿上。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1047
translate schinese ep9_lock_in_label_29a60cb5:

    # tm "I have some necks to suck."
    tm "我还得去吸几个脖子呢。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1053
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_b3ff4ef3:

    # de "[mc_de_up]! There you are. I've been meaning to ask you something."
    de "[mc_de_up]！原来你在这儿。我一直想问你件事。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1055
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_5e349b58:

    # mc "Hey! Sorry, I'm a bit all over the place right now. What do you need?"
    mc "嘿！抱歉，我现在忙得团团转。你找我什么事？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1057
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_9eb866dd:

    # de "First off, what the fuck are you wearing?"
    de "首先，你他妈穿什么玩意儿？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1059
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_868f2fa2:

    # mc "Yes, I'm wearing a skirt. I got interrupted while putting on my outfit."
    mc "是的，我穿着裙子。我正穿衣服的时候被打断了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1061
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_e7b135a4:

    # de "Are you kidding? The party's already started!"
    de "你他妈在开玩笑吗？派对都已经开始了！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1063
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_2a801e74:

    # mc "Yeah, and I've been running around trying to put out fires. Party planning isn't as much fun as I thought it would be."
    mc "对，我一直在到处跑，忙着灭火。办派对可没我想的那么好玩。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1064
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_c30227b1:

    # mc "It's super-stressful!"
    mc "这他妈太让人头疼了！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1066
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_98c1f34d:

    # de "Chill out. Come, have a beer with me."
    de "放松点。来，跟我喝一杯。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1068
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_1dc6363d:

    # mc "Thanks... It's the first one of the night."
    mc "谢了……这是我今晚喝的第一杯。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1070
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_fca0d3f9:

    # de "Drink up and you'll feel better soon."
    de "喝完这杯，你很快就会好起来的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1072
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_85fd54aa:

    # mc "You went with astronaut, huh?"
    mc "你选的是宇航员啊？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1074
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_9f2c0a16:

    # de "No. I'm an ASS-tronaut."
    de "不，我是个‘臀航员’。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1076
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_ed8c105c:

    # mc "Funny. That looks like an expensive outfit."
    mc "有意思。那身行头看起来挺贵的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1078
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_788184b5:

    # de "It wasn't too much. Still, it's Halloween! I'm gonna win that best costume contest, hands down."
    de "没花太多钱。再说了，这可是万圣节！最佳装扮比赛我赢定了，毫无悬念。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1080
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_3b7ebfa5:

    # mc "Haha, we'll see what the judges say about that."
    mc "哈哈，咱们看看评委们会怎么说。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1082
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_4b2044a3:

    # de "You're one of them, aren't you?"
    de "你也是评委，对吧？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1084
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_d85320d1:

    # mc "Yeah. It's gonna be me, Sage and Quinn."
    mc "对，评委是我、Sage和Quinn。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1087
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_1071486f:

    # de "Great. That's one out of three votes."
    de "太好了，三票已经拿下一票。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1091
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_f9a06fcd:

    # mc "Don't count on it."
    mc "别指望。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1093
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_9c4c85d0:

    # de "You don't have my back?"
    de "你不会站在我这边吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1095
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_9b3fea1b:

    # mc "I can't vote on my buddy, can I?"
    mc "我总不能因为你是我兄弟就投你吧？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1097
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_8815b0a6:

    # de "Of course, you can!"
    de "当然可以！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1099
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_760bee92:

    # mc "I'm gonna try to be fair."
    mc "我尽量公平点。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1101
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_064a1c20:

    # de "I guess I'm gonna have to bribe you then."
    de "我猜我得贿赂你了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1104
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_1583c839:

    # mc "Yeah, maybe. I'm gonna try to be fair."
    mc "嗯，也许吧。我会尽量公平一点。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1106
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_a8a09c3b:

    # mc "Why? Is Sage voting for you?"
    mc "怎么，Sage会投你？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1108
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_5c99b2dd:

    # de "[mc_de_up]! What the fuck?"
    de "[mc_de_up]！搞什么鬼？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1110
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_3f010023:

    # mc "You wanted to ask me something?"
    mc "你有什么想问我吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1112
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_a2960063:

    # de "Yeah... Speaking of feeling stressed... I've noticed you've felt that a lot lately. And not just about the party planning."
    de "嗯……说到压力感……我注意到你最近压力挺大的。不只是关于派对筹备的事。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1114
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_0f29ec38:

    # mc "*{i}Sigh{/i}* Thanks for noticing. No, it's been rough."
    mc "*{i}叹气{/i}* 谢谢你留意到了。是啊，最近确实不好过。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1116
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_c4eede1b:

    # de "So, what's up about that?"
    de "那到底怎么了？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1118
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_6966367c:

    # mc "Where the fuck should I begin?"
    mc "我他妈该从哪儿说起啊？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1120
translate schinese ep9_derek1_talk_label_2cb5035a:

    # mc "I guess it started at the Burkes..."
    mc "我想是从布克家开始的……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1141
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_779167c4:

    # mc "They're all...related?"
    mc "他们……都是一家人？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1142
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_86f9f4e7:

    # js "What?"
    js "什么？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1144
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_13444e4f:

    # mc "Is Sage a Burke!?"
    mc "Sage是伯克家的人！？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1146
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_1f4236da:

    # my "No, I think it's Morgan Burke, but she uses Morgan."
    my "不，我想是摩根·伯克，但她用的是摩根这个名字。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1148
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_556c1467:

    # mc "Yes! Exactly! Morgan! This is so bad... I... I shouldn't be here."
    mc "对！没错！摩根！这下糟了……我……我不该来这里。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1150
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_0e3e424b:

    # js "Why?"
    js "为什么？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1152
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_87d63e95:

    # sa "Ok... They're waiting."
    sa "好……他们都在等。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1153
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_ef7302f8:

    # sa "And I'm sorry in advance; I didn't think my brother would be here tonight. I'll make sure he doesn't cause any trouble for us."
    sa "还有，先跟你们说声抱歉。我没想到我哥哥今晚也在。我会看好他，不让他给我们添麻烦。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1155
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_d2e91cbd:

    # sa "[name]? Are you coming?"
    sa "[name]？你不进来吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1157
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1159
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_f822bb6c:

    # sb "Welcome, Maya. I see you've brought quite the support group. Heh."
    sb "欢迎你，Maya。看来你带来的亲友团阵仗不小啊。呵呵。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1161
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_fec27d65:

    # ty "What is he doing in our home!?"
    ty "他为什么会在我们家！？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1172
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_1568f6d6:

    # sa "He's our guest. And what the fuck are you doing here? I told you not to come."
    sa "他是我们的客人。倒是你他妈为什么在这儿？我说过不许你来的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1174
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_11b4bf5f:

    # ty "I'll come and go whenever I want to in {b}MY{/b} home."
    ty "这是{b}我{/b}家，我想什么时候来就什么时候来。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1176
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_93bb0375:

    # sb "Knock it off. We have guests."
    sb "别闹了。我们有客人。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1178
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_cbbc9184:

    # ty "Yes, Daddy."
    ty "是的，爸爸。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1181
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_46984ea3:

    # sb "..."
    sb "……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1183
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_08f05b73:

    # ja "I'm sorry, I had to freshen up. Welcome..."
    ja "抱歉，我刚才去梳洗了一下。欢迎……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1190
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_63b551b6:

    # ja "...everyone."
    ja "……各位。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1200
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_971eb943:

    # sb "Please, make yourselves at home."
    sb "请随意自在些。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1201
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_54f356b7:

    # sb "We'll be having dinner soon, so I thought I could borrow my daughter and Maya for a while."
    sb "马上就要吃晚饭了，我想先单独跟我女儿和Maya谈一会儿。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1202
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_143ee189:

    # sb "As I understand, the rest of you have great things to tell me about Maya, but I think it's best if we start this way."
    sb "据我了解，诸位也有不少关于Maya的好话要告诉我，不过最好还是先让我们这样开始。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1204
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_2439f10f:

    # sb "Honey. Refreshments?"
    sb "亲爱的，去拿些茶点好吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1207
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_7c59c308:

    # ja "Yes, of course."
    ja "当然，没问题。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1208
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_61b9f342:

    # ja "[name]. Will you help me?"
    ja "[name]，能来帮帮我吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1209
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_33902661:

    # mc "Uh... Sure..."
    mc "嗯……可以啊……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1214
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_11c7e1fc:

    # ja "What are you doing here? Are you crazy? I'm trying to keep our affair a secret and you show up unannounced!"
    ja "你他妈在这儿干嘛？疯了吗？我正努力把我们的事瞒着呢，你倒好，突然就来了！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1216
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_f7d29ae2:

    # mc "I didn't know you were Sage's mom! Do you think I would have shown up if I did?"
    mc "我根本不知道你是Sage的妈妈！我要是知道，还会跑来吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1218
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_d319fd81:

    # ja "We're the Burkes. We're among the elite of B&R."
    ja "我们是伯克家族。我们在B&R属于上流阶层。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1220
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_03c80e19:

    # mc "I don't care about school politics or whatever."
    mc "我不在乎什么学校里的派系斗争或者什么的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1221
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_f880334e:

    # mc "I wanna get out of here, but I can't because I'm here to help my friend and it will look bad if I leave."
    mc "我也想离开，可我是来帮朋友的，现在走掉只会让她难堪。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1222
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_4a68d49c:

    # mc "I'm feeling uncomfortable about this."
    mc "这状况让我浑身不自在。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1224
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_37352d82:

    # ja "Look. Don't do anything irrational."
    ja "听着，别做出什么不理智的事。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1225
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_5852cf68:

    # ja "No one suspects a thing. This situation is manageable."
    ja "没人察觉什么。这情况还能控制。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1227
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_c6ac44c1:

    # mc "Yeah. You're right."
    mc "嗯，你说得对。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1229
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_f439acc7:

    # ja "After this, don't ever show up here like this, ok?"
    ja "今晚过后，不许再像这样突然跑来，明白吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1231
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_f16c37d0:

    # mc "I'm gonna try, you know, unless Sage invites me for some reason."
    mc "我尽量吧。不过Sage要是又邀请我，我也没办法。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1233
translate schinese ep9_burkes_label_7931a684:

    # ja "You're friends with my daughter? I thought you were here for Maya."
    ja "你和我女儿是朋友？我还以为你只是陪Maya来的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:1235
