translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_f8e71871:

    # mc "It was raining that day; I wore my beige jeans as I rode my bike."
    mc "那天在下雨；我穿着米色牛仔裤骑着自行车。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2370
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_0232b47f:

    # mc "I got drenched and it looked like I had pissed all over myself."
    mc "我被淋得透湿，看起来像是把自己尿了一身。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2372
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_e370070b:

    # mc "I passed the courtyard where you taught me how to skate and smoke."
    mc "我经过了你教我滑板和抽烟的那个院子。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2373
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_a48786ca:

    # mc "I saw the lamp post I crashed into when I lost my balance skateboarding."
    mc "我看到那根我滑板时失去平衡撞上的路灯杆。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2375
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_44933acd:

    # mc "I saw the dumpsters we used to sit on. The wall still had our half-assed graffiti attempt on it."
    mc "我看到我们以前坐过的垃圾桶，墙上的涂鸦还是我们那半吊子的涂鸦作品。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2376
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_42464cb0:

    # mc "I passed the corner where we'd wait for Debbie to get liquor for you from her brother."
    mc "我经过了我们以前等黛比去她哥哥那儿给你拿酒的那个角落。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2377
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_2cc266d3:

    # mc "And I went to our mall..."
    mc "我去了我们常去的商场……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2378
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_7608001f:

    # mc "That entire bike ride was like a trip down memory lane."
    mc "那整个骑车的过程就像是一次穿越记忆的旅程。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2380
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_e07f28f2:

    # mc "I'm actually happy it rained that day. If it hadn't, everyone I passed would have seen the tears streaming down my face."
    mc "我其实挺高兴那天下雨了。要是没下雨，我经过的人都会看到我脸上的泪水。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2381
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_4ded2867:

    # mc "It was the day I got my fresh start."
    mc "那是我重新开始的一天。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2382
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_6361796d:

    # mc "I deleted everything on my phone and I bought a new SIM card...and I never sent you my new phone number."
    mc "我把手机里所有东西都删了，买了张新SIM卡……而且我再也没有给你发过我的新号码。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2384
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_a8597b0a:

    # mc "And after that day, I didn't have to stare at our chat history, hoping you'd send me something."
    mc "在那天之后，我再也不用盯着我们的聊天记录，盼着你发点什么了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2385
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_409b1d09:

    # mc "I even stopped using Rooster for a long time."
    mc "我甚至有一段时间完全没用过Rooster。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2386
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_c72ad5ec:

    # mc "Knowing that you couldn't reach me felt so good, because I didn't have to keep lying to myself and pretend to be happy when I wrote you."
    mc "知道你无法联系到我，感觉真好，因为我不用再骗自己，假装写给你时很开心。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2387
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_0372604a:

    # zo "..."
    zo "……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2389
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_399f2d92:

    # mc "And until now, I wasn't sure if you ever replied to me."
    mc "直到现在，我都不确定你有没有回过我。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2390
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_3128b74b:

    # mc "And Dad telling me that you couldn't reach me now...after all these months. I don't know if it should make me feel better or worse."
    mc "我爸告诉我你现在没法联系到我了……经历了这么多个月。我不知道这该让我感觉好点还是糟点。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2392
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_0372604a_1:

    # zo "..."
    zo "……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2394
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_ec9bf1f9:

    # zo "Your dad told me you've been happy..."
    zo "你爸跟我说你一直挺开心的……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2396
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_fe0b616f:

    # mc "Dad didn't want to embarrass me. He's seen me go through all these emotions and was unsure what to say to you."
    mc "我爸不想让我难堪。他看我经历了这么多情绪，也不知道该对你说什么。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2397
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_09191611:

    # mc "Besides, it's my story to tell you and, as I said, I'm done pretending everything's been fine."
    mc "况且，这故事该由我来告诉你，正如我刚才说的，我该停止假装一切都没事了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2407
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_c3717bca:

    # mc "I guess I can start by asking you..."
    mc "那我就先问你一个问题吧……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2408
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_670cf7e8:

    # mc "Why are you back?"
    mc "你为什么又回来了？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2410
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_eea1e39a:

    # zo "Damn... I already feel like a pile of human garbage, and now you're immediately hitting me with the million-dollar question."
    zo "靠……我本来就觉得自己烂透了，你上来就问了个最要命的问题。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2412
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_b55da31e:

    # mc "I mean... It's us."
    mc "我是说……我们俩就是这样。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2413
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_faa58836:

    # mc "It wouldn't feel right to ignore the bad feelings and start pretending how great it's been to not see each other for all this time."
    mc "要我无视那些糟糕的感受，装作这么久没见反而挺好的，我做不到。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2414
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_9094dd9c:

    # mc "I did enough of that this year..."
    mc "这一年里，我已经装得够久了……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2415
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_ed1c2bac:

    # mc "And don't give me anything about how you don't like talking feelings because this time you're gonna fucking have to."
    mc "别跟我说什么你不喜欢谈感情之类的话，这次你他妈得好好说。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2417
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_d433b086:

    # zo "You're mad at me..."
    zo "你还在生我的气……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2422
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_ca07f92d:

    # mc "You're damned right I'm mad at you."
    mc "废话，我当然生你的气。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2426
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_7b309642:

    # mc "My feelings are all over the place right now."
    mc "我的感觉现在一团糟。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2428
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_0372604a_2:

    # zo "..."
    zo "……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2430
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_2062948b:

    # zo "You're right. It wouldn't feel right to skip through that."
    zo "你说得对。现在跳过那部分感觉不太对劲。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2431
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_6067de7c:

    # zo "I guess I'm back because... I've realized a lot about myself lately."
    zo "我想我回来是因为……我最近对自己有了很多新的认识。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2433
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_110fdabd:

    # zo "I don't fit in on the West Coast. It wasn't me."
    zo "我不适合西海岸的生活。那根本就不是我。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2434
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_88505b75:

    # zo "The more time I spent over there, the more I started missing home."
    zo "我在那边待得越久，就越开始想念家。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2435
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_afedcf11:

    # zo "I was running out of money and San Diego never felt like my home."
    zo "我当时快没钱了，而且圣地亚哥从来没感觉像我的家。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2437
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_f5c5c992:

    # mc "What about surfing?"
    mc "那冲浪呢？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2439
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_c38c16b3:

    # zo "I'm horrible at it. Like, seriously, I fucking stink."
    zo "我冲得烂透了。说真的，我他妈水平臭得要命。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2441
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_7246ca24:

    # mc "From what I remember, you were getting the hang of it."
    mc "我记得你当时好像有点上手了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2443
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_d6c9d24f:

    # zo "I did. Kinda. But I never got great at it, and I think it's because I didn't like it that much."
    zo "是有点上手了。但一直算不上厉害，我想是因为自己根本没那么喜欢冲浪。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2444
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_948f3e30:

    # zo "It's so weird, you know? You build something up in your head for years, and when you finally get to do it, it's not nearly as good as you pictured it."
    zo "这事儿真他妈奇怪，你知道吗？你脑子里想了好多年的事，等真干起来，根本没想象中那么回事。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2446
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_8113ace2:

    # zo "And since it was the reason I went there, with time, I felt that... *{i}Sigh{/i}* What's the point?"
    zo "可冲浪偏偏是我去那里的理由。时间一久，我就开始觉得……*{i}叹气{/i}* 这一切到底有什么意义？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2447
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_4f340ca9:

    # zo "And like I said, I missed this place. And I..."
    zo "而且就像我说的，我怀念这里。还有……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2448
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_08d49214:

    # zo "I missed you."
    zo "我好想你。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2450
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2452
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_b99b0172:

    # zo "You might have a hard time believing that because we haven't talked since before that Friday, eight months ago, but I did."
    zo "你可能很难相信，毕竟从八个月前那个周五之前开始，我们就再没说过话……但我真的很想你。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2453
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_6c542f6d:

    # zo "And it became painfully clear with time."
    zo "随着时间推移，这变得越来越明显。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2455
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_b3909c89:

    # mc "I didn't expect to hear that."
    mc "我没想到会听到这样的话。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2456
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_b5476ca2:

    # mc "I felt that we had drifted apart in all kinds of ways- Actually, it's part of the speech I wrote..."
    mc "我原以为我们早就在各个方面渐行渐远了——其实，这也是我准备说的那些话里的一部分……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2458
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_076f2c36:

    # zo "Yeah... There's a long story behind it I need to tell you sometime."
    zo "嗯……这背后有个很长的故事，我总有一天得告诉你。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2459
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_bde4fb5e:

    # zo "There's just so much to say."
    zo "还有好多话要说。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2461
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_69c25b65:

    # mc "Yeah..."
    mc "嗯……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2462
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_cdaceb42:

    # mc "And what about your boyfriend? You just left him there?"
    mc "那你的男朋友呢？你把他一个人丢那儿了？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2464
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_c8cc77d7:

    # zo "My boyfriend? I don't have a boyfriend."
    zo "我的男朋友？我根本没男朋友。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2466
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_c6232faa:

    # mc "You do, that-"
    mc "你有啊，就是那个——"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2468
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_83591d37:

    # zo "You do!"
    zo "你才有呢！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2470
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2472
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_1889273f:

    # zo "Sorry, wrong moment."
    zo "抱歉，时机不对。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2474
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_5b026b36:

    # mc "That Bret guy."
    mc "那个叫Bret的家伙。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2476
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_d1ac586d:

    # zo "Bret's a close friend. You didn't think he was-?"
    zo "Bret只是我的好朋友。你该不会以为他是——？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2478
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_44c00005:

    # mc "I did, and then I saw this cluck you were tagged in."
    mc "我是这么以为的，后来又看见一条艾特了你的咯咯帖。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2480
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_8fe779cf:

    # zo "Oh, God..."
    zo "哦，天啊……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2482
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_3e75b8c6:

    # mc "Maybe I read into things... I tried to avoid looking at your feed, but some nights..."
    mc "也许我太敏感了……我试着不去看你的动态，但有些晚上……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2483
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_a233e87e:

    # mc "I had my weak moments..."
    mc "我也有忍不住的时候……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2485
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_c5921ad4:

    # zo "*{i}Sigh{/i}* Maybe we should have started with the easy questions?"
    zo "*{i}叹气{/i}* 也许我们该先聊点轻松的？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2487
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2489
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_4db8d69b:

    # zo "Here's one for you..."
    zo "那我问你个简单的……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2490
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_ae61d3bd:

    # zo "What are you up to these days?"
    zo "最近在忙啥呢？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2492
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_f8a18068:

    # mc "Do you know I'm in college?"
    mc "你知不知道我现在在上大学？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2494
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_e24d942e:

    # zo "Yeah, I saw it. Congrats!"
    zo "嗯，我看到了。恭喜啊！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2496
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_6cad5b7b:

    # mc "It's pretty much that. I'm studying and I pledged a frat."
    mc "基本就是上学。我在读书，还加入了一个兄弟会。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2498
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_a056d807:

    # zo "Your dad told me a bit about it. The dick boys or something?"
    zo "你爸跟我提过一点。叫什么‘鸡巴男孩’来着？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2500
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_192dfcbf:

    # mc "Haha... Almost. Dad's not that good with names. It's the DIKs."
    mc "哈哈……差不多。我爸不太记得住名字，是 DIKs。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2502
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_bdf3aea2:

    # zo "Props to you. You've moved on to doing what you wanted, with college and all."
    zo "真不错。你已经向前走了，上大学，做自己想做的事。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2504
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_ae78b915:

    # mc "What about you? What are you gonna do now?"
    mc "你呢？现在打算干啥？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2506
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_1ea61331:

    # zo "Another easy question..."
    zo "又一个‘简单’的问题……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2508
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_9a364fd1:

    # mc "You don't know?"
    mc "你不知道？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2510
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_3e261309:

    # zo "Right now, it feels good to be back home. Like, really good. I'll figure something out."
    zo "现在能回家感觉真不错，真的很不错。我会想办法的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2511
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_c915e296:

    # zo "I don't wanna live at home forever, but I don't have any rush to move out this time."
    zo "我不想永远住在家，但这次我也不急着搬出去。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2512
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_35b109bb:

    # zo "And when I move out, I won't be going far; that I know."
    zo "而且当我搬出去的时候，也不会搬太远；这点我清楚。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2514
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_eadc7d3f:

    # mc "You could look for a job."
    mc "你可以找份工作。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2516
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_4ba8c01d:

    # zo "Yeah. I probably will."
    zo "嗯，我大概会的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2517
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_19913105:

    # zo "Look, I... Fuck me. Why is it so hard to ask you stuff?"
    zo "看，我……操，为什么问你这些事这么难？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2518
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_f9593d7f:

    # zo "We've known each other for years!"
    zo "我们认识这么多年了！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2520
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_2b35b6fe_5:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2522
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_fed2536e:

    # zo "I think it's hard because I'm scared of the answer when I see the look on your face..."
    zo "我觉得很难，因为我看到你脸上的表情时，害怕听到答案。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2523
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_7dd6fd9f:

    # zo "Anyway, here it goes..."
    zo "算了，我问了……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2525
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_6bc615a9:

    # zo "Can we, like, hang out again? I know it's hard to go back to how it was..."
    zo "我们……还能再一起玩吗？我知道很难回到从前那样……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2526
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_79c47fef:

    # zo "...but what I mean is that I wanna see you again. I miss talking to you."
    zo "……但我的意思是，我还想再见到你。我很怀念和你聊天。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2527
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_8aee45da:

    # zo "I was hoping that we could press play on what we paused..."
    zo "我希望我们能给暂停的关系按下播放键，接着走下去……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2529
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_bd74923e:

    # mc "Zoey. Things are different now. College and work are taking up most of my time."
    mc "Zoey，现在不一样了。大学和工作占去了我大部分时间。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2530
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_6da86aa9:

    # mc "I'm different too. This last year has changed me."
    mc "我也不一样了。这一年彻底改变了我。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2532
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_e828c466:

    # zo "Yeah, I get it. You're busy. It's not a problem."
    zo "懂啦，我知道你很忙。没关系的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2533
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_18b6f163:

    # zo "I mean... Maybe I'll see you around when you come back home to visit your dad, at least?"
    zo "我是说……至少等你回家看你爸的时候，我们还能碰个面吧？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2535
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_385386c7:

    # mc "Zoey..."
    mc "Zoey……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2536
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_9ba8f647:

    # mc "Even though it felt like you threw me away..."
    mc "虽然我感觉自己像是被你丢掉了……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2538
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_7ac56117:

    # mc "Fuck... I tried so hard not to cry..."
    mc "操……我明明已经很努力忍住不哭了……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2542
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_9150d06a:

    # mc "I wouldn't have been able to get through my speech anyway."
    mc "反正那些准备好的话，我也不可能一口气说完。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2544
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_cc29005a:

    # mc "I still wanna see you. I mean..."
    mc "我还是想见你。我是说……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2545
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_aaa64283:

    # mc "You've been my best friend for so many years."
    mc "你是我这么多年最好的朋友。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2547
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_72a40f8f:

    # zo "*{i}Sigh of relief{/i}*"
    zo "*{i}释然的叹息{/i}*"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2549
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_53aa385c:

    # mc "But that's why it also hurts... It's gonna take some time for me. Because..."
    mc "可正因为这样，我才会这么难受……我需要一点时间。因为……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2550
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_2b35b6fe_6:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2552
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_10ab879c:

    # zo "I have all the fucking time in the universe. I'm not losing your friendship..."
    zo "我他妈有的是时间。我不会再失去你这个朋友……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2553
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_1ad59d21:

    # zo "...again."
    zo "……绝不会再来一次。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2555
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_d3883a19:

    # mc "You've changed too."
    mc "你也变了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2557
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_59107fea:

    # zo "Yeah, I've got some tattoos and more piercings now."
    zo "是啊，我现在多了些纹身，也打了更多穿孔。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2559
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_ef2d62d1:

    # mc "It's not just that."
    mc "这不只是因为这个。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2560
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_2d7e7382:

    # mc "You're not punching me or telling me to stop crying."
    mc "你居然没揍我，也没叫我别哭。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2561
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_18069bbf:

    # mc "The old you wouldn't have lasted in this conversation very long."
    mc "你以前那个样子，根本撑不过这场对话。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2563
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_8cceb10d:

    # zo "Haha!"
    zo "哈哈！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2565
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_6e6a1c0f:

    # zo "Yeah... Maybe I softened up a little?"
    zo "嗯……也许我变温柔了一点？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2567
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_c198dc5b:

    # mc "Is it a West Coast mentality?"
    mc "这是西海岸的思维方式吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2570
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_aaf3a7f8:

    # zo "I've not stopped being a dick, but I won't be today."
    zo "我还是个混蛋，只是今天不想那么混蛋。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2572
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_c1b5636d:

    # zo "Maybe that's it? I feel different."
    zo "也许就是这样？我感觉不一样了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2574
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_ace70b91:

    # mc "Whatever it is, I like it..."
    mc "不管是什么，我都喜欢……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2576
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_7d202bcb:

    # zo "So... How's college?"
    zo "那……大学生活怎么样？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2577
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_556bb5e1:

    # mc "It's...chaotic at times."
    mc "有时候……挺混乱的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2578
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_04a8c529:

    # zo "Is it fun?"
    zo "好玩吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2580
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_4a92c84e:

    # mc "It has its ups and downs, but in general, it's a blast."
    mc "有起有落，但总的来说挺带劲的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2581
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_592ec23e:

    # mc "You learn and party a lot."
    mc "既要学习，也有不少派对可玩。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2583
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_f1c1f7d9:

    # zo "Don't tell me you're a party guy these days."
    zo "别跟我说你现在是个派对狂。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2585
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_02d4952d:

    # mc "A bit more than before, yeah. I think you'd be surprised."
    mc "比以前多一点，没错。我想你会感到意外。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2586
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_0da8cf69:

    # mc "I still can't dance, though."
    mc "不过我跳舞还是不行。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2587
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_6b87f7b3:

    # mc "And don't laugh, but I'm somewhat of a party planner now too."
    mc "而且别笑，我现在也算是个派对策划了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2589
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_c7332b80:

    # zo "Hahaha! No way!"
    zo "哈哈哈！真的假的！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2591
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_38846967:

    # mc "I just started, ok? Halloween's gonna be the first party I've helped plan."
    mc "我刚开始搞这个，行了吧？万圣节的派对会是我第一次帮忙策划的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2594
translate schinese ep9_zoey_talk_label_15591afe:

    # zo "Halloween!? Dude, that's awesome! Tell me all about it."
    zo "万圣节？伙计，这太棒了！跟我说说详情。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2600
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_2b581e03:

    # de "So, you invited your ex to our Halloween party?"
    de "所以，你邀请你前任来参加我们的万圣节派对？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2602
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_f800bed0:

    # mc "Yes."
    mc "是的。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2604
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_fe2387e3:

    # de "Your ex?"
    de "你前任？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2606
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_84d9991b:

    # mc "Yes..."
    mc "嗯……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2608
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_b16a5b57:

    # de "To our Halloween party?"
    de "还邀请到我们的万圣节派对上？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2610
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_79bfb159:

    # mc "What's your point?"
    mc "你什么意思？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2612
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_e694dd66:

    # de "Don't you see why that's a bad idea?"
    de "你没看到这主意有多糟糕吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2614
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_96f08fee:

    # mc "She's not just my ex... I don't think she ever saw me that way..."
    mc "她不只是我的前任……而且我觉得她可能从没把我当成真正的男朋友……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2615
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_f974ca6e:

    # mc "She's my best friend."
    mc "她是我最好的朋友。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2617
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_e132f68d:

    # de "How dare you!"
    de "你怎么敢这么说！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2619
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_1efdcccc:

    # mc "Well, she is...or was... I don't know. It's complicated."
    mc "嗯，她是……或者以前是……我也不知道。事情很复杂。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2622
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_3dee27d7:

    # de "Answer me this - and don't you lie to me."
    de "回答我这个问题——别骗我。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2623
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_acf24fb0:

    # de "Is she a better friend than me?"
    de "她这个朋友比我还好？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2629
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_9fc5407e:

    # mc "She's treated me like shit by ghosting me, and part of me is still mad at her for that...but still..."
    mc "她一声不吭地断了联系，简直没把我当回事。我心里有一部分到现在还在生她的气……可即便如此……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2630
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_accb5ec1:

    # mc "She's my oldest friend, bro. You're a great friend, but she's pretty much irreplaceable."
    mc "她是我认识最久的朋友，兄弟。你也是很好的朋友，可她几乎无可替代。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2632
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_7609d1bf:

    # de "*{i}Gasps{/i}*"
    de "*{i}惊呼{/i}*"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2634
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_8176ff71:

    # mc "Don't be like that. Zoey helped me get through some hard times-"
    mc "别这样。Zoey陪我熬过了不少艰难的时候——"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2636
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_7160dd2f:

    # de "No, no. I heard you. Loud and clear."
    de "不，不。我听到了。清清楚楚。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2637
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_43e107b8:

    # de "Derek out."
    de "Derek退场。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2642
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_9ced3ebe:

    # mc "No, she's not a better friend than you."
    mc "不，她不是比你更好的朋友。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2644
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_dca80cd1:

    # mc "No, she's not a better friend than you. She's great, but she left me and stopped talking to me."
    mc "不，她不是比你更好的朋友。她很棒，但她把我甩了，直接断了联系。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2647
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_d49ff52d:

    # mc "She cut me out of her life without even talking to me about it. I'm having a hard time forgiving her for that."
    mc "她直接把我从她的生活中剔除了，连个解释都没给我。我到现在还很难原谅她这么做。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2649
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_29078c23:

    # mc "It felt like she was cutting me out of her life. It's hard to forget about that."
    mc "感觉她把我从她的生活中排除出去了，这种事很难忘掉。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2650
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_f69f8f87:

    # mc "But we used to be best friends and she's helped me get through some hard times in life."
    mc "但我们曾经是最好的朋友，她在我人生中一些艰难的时刻帮助过我。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2652
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_60d29c0e:

    # de "I got it. Let me talk to her and see what I can do for you."
    de "我明白了。我去跟她谈谈，看看能为你做点什么。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2654
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_70398e1c:

    # mc "Hey. You don't have to do anything for me. Don't talk to her and tell her things about me."
    mc "嘿，你不用为我做任何事。别去找她，别跟她说什么关于我的事。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2656
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_65e0f361:

    # de "Don't worry, [mc_de]. I can be a real sweetheart."
    de "别担心，[mc_de]。我也可以体贴得要命。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2664
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_f4d11690:

    # mc "*{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    mc "*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2666
translate schinese ep9_derek_talk4_label_7963f651:

    # mc "(I better get my costume ready.)"
    mc "（我得把化装服准备好了。）"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2674
translate schinese ep9_wave1_label_3a2cfb26:

    # mc "{i}That night, the guests came in waves.{/i}"
    mc "{i}那晚，客人们一波接一波地来了。{/i}"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2676
translate schinese ep9_wave1_label_9dd0275f:

    # mc "{i}First to the party were the dormies.{/i}"
    mc "{i}最先到派对的是宿舍里的家伙们。{/i}"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2677
translate schinese ep9_wave1_label_931fcb42:

    # mc "{i}As Tommy explained, dorm people who love to party with us come early, so they don't miss out.{/i}"
    mc "{i}正如Tommy所说，宿舍里那些爱参加我们派对的人总会早早到场，生怕错过什么。{/i}"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2679
translate schinese ep9_wave1_label_0902f44b:

    # mc "{i}They aren't the most fun people to hang around, but some of them might surprise you.{/i}"
    mc "{i}他们不是最有趣的人，但有些人可能会让你意外。{/i}"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2681
translate schinese ep9_wave1_label_c156e956:

    # mc "{i}We all looked forward to the drinking competition. The party was off to a great start.{/i}"
    mc "{i}我们都在期待着饮酒比赛。派对一开始就非常精彩。{/i}"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2683
translate schinese ep9_wave1_label_742aa6c3:

    # mc "{i}We had a shot battle coming up, so fun times started early on.{/i}"
    mc "{i}接下来还有拼酒大赛，所以派对很早就热闹了起来。{/i}"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2685
translate schinese ep9_wave1_label_5ba5c3b2:

    # mc "{i}We didn't have anything special planned for them, but fun times started early even so.{/i}"
    mc "{i}我们本来没打算给他们安排什么特别的计划，但有趣的事情却早早开始了。{/i}"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2688
translate schinese ep9_wave1_label_83685435:

    # mc "(There. Now it's not just a skirt.)"
    mc "（搞定。现在这裙子可不一般了。）"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2690
translate schinese ep9_wave1_label_ec4af80d:

    # mc "(Where's my sword...?)"
    mc "（我的剑呢……）"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2691
translate schinese ep9_wave1_label_3a096b87:

    # mc "(Dammit... Where did I put it?)"
    mc "（该死……我放哪儿去了？）"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2714
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_893a8513:

    # mc "{i}The HOTs came later than expected.{/i}"
    mc "{i}HOTs 比预想中来得更晚。{/i}"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2715
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_3a3058bd:

    # mc "{i}At least it felt that way; maybe it's because the dormies came early.{/i}"
    mc "{i}至少感觉是这样；也许是因为宿舍的人来得早。{/i}"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2717
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_e0a15a57:

    # mc "{i}Showing up a bit late was the HOTs' thing tonight. It was like they were the main event.{/i}"
    mc "{i}HOTs 今晚故意姗姗来迟，仿佛她们才是压轴登场的主角。{/i}"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2718
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_6243f00f:

    # mc "{i}And boy, did they look the part.{/i}"
    mc "{i}而且，他们看起来确实很像那么回事。{/i}"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2720
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_87b4d24d:

    # qu "All right, party people! You can stop wondering where the party's at - it just arrived."
    qu "好了，各位派对咖！不用再问派对在哪儿了——派对本人刚刚到场。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2764
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_92067460:

    # de "I don't see Ashley..."
    de "我没看见Ashley……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2766
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_fdde5d95:

    # mc "Maybe she's in a costume? It can be hard to tell."
    mc "也许她穿着化装服，认不出来？确实不好说。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2768
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_15b66959:

    # de "Yeah, I'm gonna look for her."
    de "我得去找她。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2772
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_fd730814:

    # mc "There's Jill."
    mc "Jill在那边。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2774
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_35842ef8:

    # isa "I see her."
    isa "我看到她了。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2776
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_6228c3d3:

    # mc "So, what's the plan?"
    mc "那咱们接下来打算怎么做？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2778
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_a7d09400:

    # isa "I don't know yet. I don't want to scare her away."
    isa "还不知道呢。我不想吓跑她。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2783
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_3a808496:

    # mc "Take it easy with her and you won't."
    mc "慢慢来，别把她逼得太紧，她就不会被吓跑。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2785
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_724529da:

    # isa "I hope so."
    isa "希望如此。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2788
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_19e921e5:

    # mc "Is she scared of mummies?"
    mc "她被木乃伊吓到了吗？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2790
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_fb623a7e:

    # isa "..."
    isa "……"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2794
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_79a9c9f3:

    # mc "(And there are Josy and Maya...)"
    mc "（还有Josy和Maya……）"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2795
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_96660aa9:

    # mc "(I can't avoid them tonight... Fuck... Now I regret not telling them sooner about my decision.)"
    mc "（今晚我是躲不开她们了……操……真后悔没早点把自己的决定告诉她们。）"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2796
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_9e3f4e4e:

    # mc "(If I play it cool and friendly, I should be fine.)"
    mc "（如果我装得镇定又友好，应该没问题。）"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2798
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_6500765d:

    # mc "I'm gonna greet the HOTs and check if everything's under control with the party. Will you be ok?"
    mc "我去和 HOTs 打个招呼，顺便看看派对是不是一切正常。你一个人没问题吧？"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2800
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_6398d656:

    # isa "Don't worry about me. Come find me when you're done."
    isa "别担心我，你忙完来找我就行。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2803
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_d4fc9610:

    # mc "(There's Josy and Maya...)"
    mc "（有Josy和Maya在那儿……）"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2804
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_9ba42839:

    # mc "(I can't avoid them tonight... Fuck... Now, I regret not telling them sooner about my decision.)"
    mc "（今晚我是躲不开她们了……操……真后悔没早点把自己的决定告诉她们。）"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2805
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_9e3f4e4e_1:

    # mc "(If I play it cool and friendly, I should be fine.)"
    mc "（只要表现得轻松友好，应该就没事。）"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2811
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_f9fa326e:

    # sa "[name]!"
    sa "[name]！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2816
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_db2ffca3:

    # sa "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    sa "*{i}亲吻声{/i}*"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2820
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_cfd805e7:

    # sa "*{i}Smack{/i}* Mmm! Finally!"
    sa "*{i}亲吻声{/i}* 嗯！终于等到你了！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2823
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_e95a86c1:

    # mc "(They didn't see that...right?)"
    mc "（她们没看见刚才那一幕……对吧？）"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2824
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_67d3c275:

    # sa "Uh? [name]? Over here?"
    sa "咦？[name]？看这边！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2826
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_699878f6:

    # mc "Hey!"
    mc "嘿！"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2829
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_b1b86082:

    # mc "Yeah! Finally! I've been waiting for you."
    mc "太好了！终于来了！我一直在等你。"

# episode9\update9.rpy:2835
translate schinese ep9_wave2_label_071178ef:

